{"seq":3,"slug":"audio-graph-and-mixing","title":"音频图与混音：Mixer Graph、Bus Hierarchy 与路由设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-audio-programming/audio-fundamentals/audio-graph-and-mixing","wordCount":1115,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"音频图与混音-mixer-graph-bus-hierarchy-与路由设计\">音频图与混音：Mixer Graph、Bus Hierarchy 与路由设计</h1><p>音频图（Audio Graph）是游戏音频系统的信号流核心——它定义声音如何从原始 PCM 数据流经 DSP 处理节点、汇入混音总线、最终输出到硬件。理解总线层级、发送/返回（Send/Return）和侧链压缩，是实现专业级混音效果的关键。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>混音图（Mixer Graph）</strong>：有向无环图，节点为 DSP 处理单元，边为 PCM 数据流，声音从源节点经处理链汇入输出。</li>\n<li><strong>Bus Hierarchy（总线层级）</strong>：将声音按类型（武器/音乐/对话）分组管理，每组共享音量控制和 DSP 效果，典型 3-4 层。</li>\n<li><strong>Send/Return（发送/返回）</strong>：将信号副本发往辅助效果总线，多声源共享同一效果器实例，节省 CPU 开销。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"音频信号图基础\">音频信号图基础</h2><p>音频图是一个<strong>有向无环图（DAG）</strong>，节点是处理单元，边是音频数据流：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[Sound Source\\n声音源] --&gt; B[Volume/Pan\\n音量/声像]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Low-pass Filter\\n低通滤波]&#10;    C --&gt; D[SFX Bus\\n音效总线]&#10;    D --&gt; E[Reverb Send\\n混响发送]&#10;    D --&gt; F[Master Bus\\n主总线]&#10;    E --&gt; G[Reverb Return\\n混响返回]&#10;    G --&gt; F&#10;    H[Music Bus\\n音乐总线] --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; I[Limiter\\n限幅器]&#10;    I --&gt; J[Hardware Output\\n硬件输出]\">graph LR\n    A[Sound Source\\n声音源] --&gt; B[Volume/Pan\\n音量/声像]\n    B --&gt; C[Low-pass Filter\\n低通滤波]\n    C --&gt; D[SFX Bus\\n音效总线]\n    D --&gt; E[Reverb Send\\n混响发送]\n    D --&gt; F[Master Bus\\n主总线]\n    E --&gt; G[Reverb Return\\n混响返回]\n    G --&gt; F\n    H[Music Bus\\n音乐总线] --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; I[Limiter\\n限幅器]\n    I --&gt; J[Hardware Output\\n硬件输出]</pre><p><strong>关键约束</strong>：图必须是 DAG（无环），否则会产生无限反馈。混响的 Send/Return 看似形成环路，但它们通过延迟（内部缓冲）打破了反馈环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"bus-hierarchy-总线层级\">Bus Hierarchy（总线层级）</h2><p>专业游戏音频项目通常设计 3-4 层总线层级：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Master Bus（主总线）&#10;├── Music Bus（音乐总线）&#10;│   ├── BGM Track（背景音乐）&#10;│   └── Sting Bus（插曲/Stinger）&#10;├── SFX Bus（音效总线）&#10;│   ├── Weapon Bus（武器音效）&#10;│   ├── Footstep Bus（脚步声）&#10;│   ├── UI Bus（界面音效）&#10;│   └── Ambient Bus（环境音）&#10;├── Voice Bus（语音总线）&#10;│   ├── Dialogue Bus（对话）&#10;│   └── Narrator Bus（旁白）&#10;└── Aux Bus（辅助总线）&#10;    ├── Reverb Return（混响返回）&#10;    └── Delay Return（延迟返回）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Master Bus（主总线）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── Music Bus（音乐总线）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── BGM Track（背景音乐）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── Sting Bus（插曲/Stinger）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── SFX Bus（音效总线）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── Weapon Bus（武器音效）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── Footstep Bus（脚步声）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── UI Bus（界面音效）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── Ambient Bus（环境音）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── Voice Bus（语音总线）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── Dialogue Bus（对话）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── Narrator Bus（旁白）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── Aux Bus（辅助总线）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ├── Reverb Return（混响返回）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └── Delay Return（延迟返回）</span></span></code></pre></div><p>每个总线节点可以独立设置音量、DSP 效果链和路由目标。分组的好处：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>好处</th>\n<th>具体场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>统一控制</td>\n<td>一个旋钮控制所有武器音效音量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>统一 DSP</td>\n<td>所有对话音效共享同一个 EQ 和压缩器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混音自动化</td>\n<td>对话开始时自动压低音乐音量（Ducking）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能优化</td>\n<td>静音整条总线跳过该路径的 DSP 计算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"信号路由-direct-与-send-return\">信号路由：Direct 与 Send/Return</h2><p>声音的信号路径有两种模式：</p>\n<h3 id=\"direct-path-直接路由\">Direct Path（直接路由）</h3><p>声音只输出到其父级总线，是最简单也最常用的路由：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"// Wwise Bus 设置示例（概念代码）&#10;SoundInstance inst;&#10;inst.setOutputBus(&quot;SFX_Bus&quot;);  // 直接输出到 SFX 总线&#10;inst.setVolume(0.8f);&#10;inst.play();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Wwise Bus 设置示例（概念代码）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">SoundInstance inst;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">inst.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setOutputBus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SFX_Bus\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 直接输出到 SFX 总线</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">inst.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setVolume</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.8</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">inst.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">play</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"send-return-发送-返回\">Send/Return（发送/返回）</h3><p>将信号的一份<strong>拷贝</strong>发送到辅助总线（通常是效果器总线），原始信号继续走主路径：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    src[声音源] --&gt; |100% 干信号| mainBus[SFX Bus]&#10;    src --&gt; |30% 发送量| reverbBus[Reverb Bus]&#10;    reverbBus --&gt; |效果后信号| returnBus[Reverb Return]&#10;    returnBus --&gt; mainBus&#10;    mainBus --&gt; masterBus[Master Bus]\">flowchart LR\n    src[声音源] --&gt; |100% 干信号| mainBus[SFX Bus]\n    src --&gt; |30% 发送量| reverbBus[Reverb Bus]\n    reverbBus --&gt; |效果后信号| returnBus[Reverb Return]\n    returnBus --&gt; mainBus\n    mainBus --&gt; masterBus[Master Bus]</pre><p>Send/Return 的核心优势：<strong>多个声源共享同一个混响效果器实例</strong>，而不是每个声源运行独立的混响——这在有数十个需要混响处理的声音时节省大量 CPU。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"// FMOD Send 设置&#10;FMOD::DSP* reverbSend;&#10;system-&gt;createDSPByType(FMOD_DSP_TYPE_SEND, &amp;reverbSend);&#10;reverbSend-&gt;setParameterFloat(FMOD_DSP_RETURN_ID, reverbReturnID);&#10;reverbSend-&gt;setParameterFloat(FMOD_DSP_RETURN_LEVEL, 0.3f);  // 30% 发送量&#10;&#10;channelGroup-&gt;addDSP(0, reverbSend);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// FMOD Send 设置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">FMOD</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::DSP</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reverbSend;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">system-></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createDSPByType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(FMOD_DSP_TYPE_SEND, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">reverbSend);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">reverbSend-></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setParameterFloat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(FMOD_DSP_RETURN_ID, reverbReturnID);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">reverbSend-></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setParameterFloat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(FMOD_DSP_RETURN_LEVEL, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 30% 发送量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">channelGroup-></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addDSP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reverbSend);</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"侧链压缩-ducking\">侧链压缩（Ducking）</h2><p>侧链压缩是混音中最重要的自动化技术，用于在关键声音出现时自动降低其他声音的音量：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    dialogue[对话音轨\\n控制信号] --&gt; |侧链输入| compressor[压缩器\\nSidechain]&#10;    musicBus[音乐总线\\n目标信号] --&gt; compressor&#10;    compressor --&gt; output[压缩后音乐\\n自动降低音量]\">flowchart LR\n    dialogue[对话音轨\\n控制信号] --&gt; |侧链输入| compressor[压缩器\\nSidechain]\n    musicBus[音乐总线\\n目标信号] --&gt; compressor\n    compressor --&gt; output[压缩后音乐\\n自动降低音量]</pre><p><strong>Ducking 参数设置</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>典型值</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Threshold</td>\n<td>-20 dB</td>\n<td>对话信号超过此阈值开始压缩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ratio</td>\n<td>4:1</td>\n<td>超过阈值部分压缩比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Attack</td>\n<td>20-50 ms</td>\n<td>检测到信号后多快开始压缩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Release</td>\n<td>200-500 ms</td>\n<td>信号消失后多快恢复原音量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Duck Amount</td>\n<td>-8 dB</td>\n<td>最大降低量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"// 基于参数的 Ducking 实现（无第三方中间件）&#10;class SidechainDucker {&#10;    float currentGain = 1.0f;&#10;    float attackTime = 0.02f;   // 20ms&#10;    float releaseTime = 0.3f;   // 300ms&#10;    float threshold = 0.25f;    // -12 dBFS&#10;    float duckAmount = 0.4f;    // -8 dB（约 0.4 线性）&#10;&#10;public:&#10;    float processGain(float sideChainLevel, float dt) {&#10;        float targetGain = (sideChainLevel &gt; threshold) ? duckAmount : 1.0f;&#10;&#10;        float speed = (targetGain &lt; currentGain)&#10;                    ? 1.0f / attackTime    // 压缩（快）&#10;                    : 1.0f / releaseTime;  // 释放（慢）&#10;&#10;        // 线性平滑（实际应用指数曲线）&#10;        currentGain += (targetGain - currentGain) * speed * dt;&#10;        return currentGain;&#10;    }&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 基于参数的 Ducking 实现（无第三方中间件）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SidechainDucker</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> currentGain </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> attackTime </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.02</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   // 20ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> releaseTime </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   // 300ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> threshold </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.25</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // -12 dBFS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> duckAmount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.4</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // -8 dB（约 0.4 线性）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> processGain</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> sideChainLevel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> dt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> targetGain </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (sideChainLevel </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> threshold) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> duckAmount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> speed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (targetGain </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> currentGain)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                    ?</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> attackTime</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 压缩（快）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                    :</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> releaseTime;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 释放（慢）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 线性平滑（实际应用指数曲线）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        currentGain </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (targetGain </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> currentGain) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> speed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> currentGain;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"音频图的处理顺序\">音频图的处理顺序</h2><p>音频图节点的处理顺序至关重要，影响效果质量和延迟：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Source 解码\\nDecode PCM] --&gt; B[个声源 DSP\\nPer-voice EQ/Filter]&#10;    B --&gt; C[3D 空间化\\nSpatialization]&#10;    C --&gt; D[Bus 混合\\nMixing]&#10;    D --&gt; E[Bus DSP\\nBus Compressor/EQ]&#10;    E --&gt; F[Send 处理\\nFX Send]&#10;    F --&gt; G[主总线 DSP\\nMaster Limiter]&#10;    G --&gt; H[输出\\nOutput]\">graph TD\n    A[Source 解码\\nDecode PCM] --&gt; B[个声源 DSP\\nPer-voice EQ/Filter]\n    B --&gt; C[3D 空间化\\nSpatialization]\n    C --&gt; D[Bus 混合\\nMixing]\n    D --&gt; E[Bus DSP\\nBus Compressor/EQ]\n    E --&gt; F[Send 处理\\nFX Send]\n    F --&gt; G[主总线 DSP\\nMaster Limiter]\n    G --&gt; H[输出\\nOutput]</pre><p>每帧处理的典型时间预算（以 512 帧/48kHz 为例，约 10.67ms 时间窗口）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>处理阶段</th>\n<th>典型 CPU 占用</th>\n<th>可优化手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>PCM 解码</td>\n<td>1-3 ms</td>\n<td>预解码、使用硬件解码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>个声源 DSP</td>\n<td>2-4 ms</td>\n<td>距离阈值截断 DSP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3D 空间化</td>\n<td>0.5-2 ms</td>\n<td>HRTF 表查找 vs 实时计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合汇入总线</td>\n<td>0.5-1 ms</td>\n<td>SIMD 向量化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>总线 DSP</td>\n<td>1-2 ms</td>\n<td>仅处理非静默总线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主总线处理</td>\n<td>0.2-0.5 ms</td>\n<td>轻量限幅器</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"静态图-vs-动态图\">静态图 vs 动态图</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>静态图</th>\n<th>动态图</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>配置时机</td>\n<td>项目初始化时固定</td>\n<td>运行时动态增删节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运行时开销</td>\n<td>低（无拓扑变更）</td>\n<td>高（需要重新排序/锁定）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>灵活性</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>Wwise/FMOD 预设图</td>\n<td>程序化音景、动态效果链</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>混合策略</strong>：使用静态图骨架（固定 Bus 层级），通过节点参数动态调节（音量/效果量/路由开关），在灵活性和性能之间取得平衡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>音频图是 DAG 结构的信号处理网络，Bus Hierarchy 将声音分组管理，Send/Return 实现效果共享，侧链压缩实现 Ducking 自动化。处理顺序从个声源 DSP 到 3D 空间化再到总线混合，每个阶段有独立的时间预算。静态图优先用于固定架构，动态参数调节提供运行时灵活性。</p>\n<p><strong>同章节其他内容</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"digital-audio-fundamentals\">数字音频基础</a> — 音频图的每个节点处理的都是 PCM 浮点缓冲</li>\n<li><a href=\"audio-engine-architecture\">音频引擎架构</a> — Wwise/FMOD 的 Bus 系统是本文混音图的具体实现</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"音频图与混音：Mixer Graph、Bus Hierarchy 与路由设计","id":"音频图与混音-mixer-graph-bus-hierarchy-与路由设计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"音频信号图基础","id":"音频信号图基础"},{"level":2,"text":"Bus Hierarchy（总线层级）","id":"bus-hierarchy-总线层级"},{"level":2,"text":"信号路由：Direct 与 Send/Return","id":"信号路由-direct-与-send-return"},{"level":3,"text":"Direct Path（直接路由）","id":"direct-path-直接路由"},{"level":3,"text":"Send/Return（发送/返回）","id":"send-return-发送-返回"},{"level":2,"text":"侧链压缩（Ducking）","id":"侧链压缩-ducking"},{"level":2,"text":"音频图的处理顺序","id":"音频图的处理顺序"},{"level":2,"text":"静态图 vs 动态图","id":"静态图-vs-动态图"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"音频引擎架构：Wwise、FMOD 与 Audio Manager 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-audio-programming/audio-fundamentals/audio-engine-architecture"},"next":{"title":"3D 定位音频：距离衰减、多普勒效应与声像","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-audio-programming/spatial-audio/3d-positional-audio"}}